{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:26:04Z","created_by_operation":"op_9b019dd07bf941088bdc006a739c9195","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_09003e45565102f98d3168c4bb3fe7f22f9a0d48b0aee2646e48fc301ba631ef","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"yeachan-heo/oh-my-claudecode@5281b19e0d64 snapshot 1fded3a5854f6853","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_ca638b2372ce6020f6e4e1e47bf326a3b11e0c507775c8c06051ab2954c5f2b7"],"source_ids":["src_223e0d21fb59585da4a1cf5bca8f77fe"],"text":"OMC exposes two surfaces: terminal CLI commands (`omc ...`) run from a shell, and in-session slash skills (`/...`) run inside a Claude Code session after plugin setup.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:26:04Z","updated_by_operation":"op_9b019dd07bf941088bdc006a739c9195"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:26:04Z","created_by_operation":"op_9b019dd07bf941088bdc006a739c9195","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_0e5763ee6372f991b1537f41f90b736a539a313d970833937dd88a6370b319b8","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"yeachan-heo/oh-my-claudecode@5281b19e0d64 snapshot 1fded3a5854f6853","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_5eeb0edd878f5c230c107db9a79d6efe88409e5e1fd84885d0ce67b763a6e7d7","slc_6bd9c0477f9fe9166b132a12b2e7e7728e6ee1da4fd2643c53ec49fda2ee7eb1","slc_b510821c4b313e39072ae3a45389381ced325b60c901835da9a76b7736be19dc"],"source_ids":["src_223e0d21fb59585da4a1cf5bca8f77fe"],"text":"OMC writes runtime state, session data, plans, logs, and artifacts under `.omc/` by default; gitignore keeps it local except `.omc/skills/**` which stays committable, and `OMC_STATE_DIR` or a `.omc-workspace` marker can relocate or share state.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:26:04Z","updated_by_operation":"op_9b019dd07bf941088bdc006a739c9195"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:26:04Z","created_by_operation":"op_9b019dd07bf941088bdc006a739c9195","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_0f495dbf894e1c3a06937302fa937b83c64e8813de20f0cd16694b5e9aa86f95","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"yeachan-heo/oh-my-claudecode@5281b19e0d64 snapshot 1fded3a5854f6853","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1b68b43fe576bbc15be71ce4f4699f695bce33a927ac396f3e9630856e16373b","slc_b64d96bfc8fa6b391ce9480e3634de71f3a29099c32160a78dee1435f7bf4b07","slc_d3a977f003cf24665df81518ec8b3b9b7358d7da1a335b345d5dd3d864577d3e"],"source_ids":["src_223e0d21fb59585da4a1cf5bca8f77fe"],"text":"`omc team N:<provider>` spawns on-demand tmux worker panes for claude, codex, gemini, antigravity, grok, or cursor CLIs; workers die when their task completes, and the selected CLI plus tmux must be installed and authenticated.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:26:04Z","updated_by_operation":"op_9b019dd07bf941088bdc006a739c9195"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:26:04Z","created_by_operation":"op_9b019dd07bf941088bdc006a739c9195","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_3cb4573ad335aabe827764be1312b3881737bf8dda63fab96975e80008b5514b","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"yeachan-heo/oh-my-claudecode@5281b19e0d64 snapshot 1fded3a5854f6853","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_fa551e91b6cf3d3f72e60fe30d4ae696d390d4c8616cb834ad9d8e57884ec26f"],"source_ids":["src_223e0d21fb59585da4a1cf5bca8f77fe"],"text":"Repository development practice: CONTRIBUTING.md is the developer guide covering forking, local checkout setup, linking as the active plugin, running tests, and submitting PRs.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:26:04Z","updated_by_operation":"op_9b019dd07bf941088bdc006a739c9195"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:26:04Z","created_by_operation":"op_9b019dd07bf941088bdc006a739c9195","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_4358309eff6d658bbc338075d2a66c0963d352053e411dd02b0d54a4b8a7799e","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"yeachan-heo/oh-my-claudecode@5281b19e0d64 snapshot 1fded3a5854f6853","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_78df447efac5057ad4b3c8d0009569edd31471497ad2e36d6b6aace609210feb","slc_af155e21c92b3ffb53409e46e18d01da9cefa32e2d97f78a3ffc7ed7b422f620"],"source_ids":["src_223e0d21fb59585da4a1cf5bca8f77fe"],"text":"The npm package installs both `oh-my-claudecode` and a short `omc` command alias, while the repo/plugin branding is oh-my-claudecode.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:26:04Z","updated_by_operation":"op_9b019dd07bf941088bdc006a739c9195"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:26:04Z","created_by_operation":"op_9b019dd07bf941088bdc006a739c9195","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_44277a6e0b722de587bb276fb95dff6a87c08632da073940cc992a9045fd806e","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"yeachan-heo/oh-my-claudecode@5281b19e0d64 snapshot 1fded3a5854f6853","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_42e74c7edb1ea38d81e9d71f5903fba26db4596deadbdca734ace00a37b96e3c"],"source_ids":["src_223e0d21fb59585da4a1cf5bca8f77fe"],"text":"OMC does not ship a VS Code extension or document extension-specific install flows; interactive slash commands like /autopilot and /team require an active Claude Code session and should not be relied on in CI.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:26:04Z","updated_by_operation":"op_9b019dd07bf941088bdc006a739c9195"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:26:04Z","created_by_operation":"op_9b019dd07bf941088bdc006a739c9195","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_66942730338b47cba0334580b256f77caf3dc4e8f745e67075825e069cc49d99","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"yeachan-heo/oh-my-claudecode@5281b19e0d64 snapshot 1fded3a5854f6853","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2e0c5346e3482d65998eadfcedb4f4a58c9edd7aaa493026c7bcd5d97f42ad71"],"source_ids":["src_223e0d21fb59585da4a1cf5bca8f77fe"],"text":"The CLI depends on better-sqlite3, whose upstream prebuild-install@7.1.3 dependency triggers a deprecation warning during npm install; the warning is tracked in issue #2913 and does not indicate install failure.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:26:04Z","updated_by_operation":"op_9b019dd07bf941088bdc006a739c9195"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:26:04Z","created_by_operation":"op_9b019dd07bf941088bdc006a739c9195","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_884722d1299b559920bc9207466615de89915d8bf62a82f4f9d3f1d7cf139093","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"yeachan-heo/oh-my-claudecode@5281b19e0d64 snapshot 1fded3a5854f6853","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_8249892125cc914be3d04f7abbd4f0fb78db584918b98d4907202e54909539cc","slc_82d66fdb8033602b390f37e6548c77adada4081e9dac88064fd148f7c0042e24","slc_f431d93dbc3eaa2687d91d82627a29e9903ba73ef56193aa41db6a7ed374b22e"],"source_ids":["src_223e0d21fb59585da4a1cf5bca8f77fe"],"text":"Requirements include the Claude Code CLI plus a Claude Max/Pro subscription or Anthropic API key, and tmux is required for features like `omc team` and rate-limit detection.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:26:04Z","updated_by_operation":"op_9b019dd07bf941088bdc006a739c9195"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:26:04Z","created_by_operation":"op_9b019dd07bf941088bdc006a739c9195","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_948fe740e11c0833a4b8d13853e7743fb370f3b502fa9fdf45e31ae2cc3c83a7","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"yeachan-heo/oh-my-claudecode@5281b19e0d64 snapshot 1fded3a5854f6853","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_46d16f95b51739bede51f9e9647e08a50f26067535f70f56396ba93d1a4b5ceb","slc_73da0103db1eba74fec3ef19edaf1d9f5dc3470d0f78c69095108b0186d30794","slc_d2374163edc232dec7ff89f497cc2cfb7b8edbd680d74566a5b1197d3480919f"],"source_ids":["src_223e0d21fb59585da4a1cf5bca8f77fe"],"text":"Named autopilot stage profiles (v1) are selected via `/autopilot --workflow <name>`, configured under `autopilot.workflows` in project or user config, and admit only four fixed stage sequences such as [ralplan, execution, qa].","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:26:04Z","updated_by_operation":"op_9b019dd07bf941088bdc006a739c9195"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:26:04Z","created_by_operation":"op_9b019dd07bf941088bdc006a739c9195","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a7d0a0341cadb84f57656a38bf5d58105a8f7c34a6c58cbb7ff6a7143b50642e","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=skills-patterns","setting":"yeachan-heo/oh-my-claudecode@5281b19e0d64 snapshot 1fded3a5854f6853","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1d5d939a3de16fcca866c5151eadb51886cca964e98cfc3ba877cda71122f4df","slc_c78bc5f6628e5b4d33c6b1b4299f6d23fef2652a45a64a4366e70a7e52bdf662","slc_ea801e68b1e6767cc02bc4c19176eea91b2f8bec65a4014210eae768e7f39791"],"source_ids":["src_223e0d21fb59585da4a1cf5bca8f77fe"],"text":"Custom skills are stored at `.omc/skills/` (project, higher priority) or `~/.omc/skills/` (user fallback), with frontmatter triggers, and matching skills auto-inject into context; `/skillify` extracts patterns with quality gates.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:26:04Z","updated_by_operation":"op_9b019dd07bf941088bdc006a739c9195"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:26:04Z","created_by_operation":"op_9b019dd07bf941088bdc006a739c9195","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c4fd0e5e0c1c5147a32fc79116d88def0cc58fe9362ce92d6b69563e14ccdad3","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"yeachan-heo/oh-my-claudecode@5281b19e0d64 snapshot 1fded3a5854f6853","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_b429f5f463dce5614d3d700b669fab4e34c5e69d6d524cff144bf1083baa0ce1"],"source_ids":["src_223e0d21fb59585da4a1cf5bca8f77fe"],"text":"Named autopilot profiles currently require Linux with `flock`; unsupported environments reject explicit `--workflow` invocation before changing autopilot state, while legacy autopilot remains available.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:26:04Z","updated_by_operation":"op_9b019dd07bf941088bdc006a739c9195"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:26:04Z","created_by_operation":"op_9b019dd07bf941088bdc006a739c9195","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_ce98890160ea249edd83407136fc2437fa2835f79abf463fd2aa295817dc6488","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"yeachan-heo/oh-my-claudecode@5281b19e0d64 snapshot 1fded3a5854f6853","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_6e69a29930a7029d97de1383cdc7fe15b85badb68fb64c9260a52d034c249b14"],"source_ids":["src_223e0d21fb59585da4a1cf5bca8f77fe"],"text":"Outside a git repository OMC uses a canonical state root at `~/.omc/` (or `$OMC_STATE_DIR/non-git`) and avoids creating per-cwd state roots or writing into sensitive directories like `~/.ssh` or `~/Downloads`.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:26:04Z","updated_by_operation":"op_9b019dd07bf941088bdc006a739c9195"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:26:04Z","created_by_operation":"op_9b019dd07bf941088bdc006a739c9195","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_ded61db43c3f57585ad0f728664933c5ebff742717264563189c8cfed72f52a1","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"yeachan-heo/oh-my-claudecode@5281b19e0d64 snapshot 1fded3a5854f6853","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_c5572bef9a71143c84d88b3761cebb67930e7c5c307f8f16a1f40a19231d4188","slc_e4ea290818e47282faf2dca1febcc10a82acd43b277c6ae0ee6f36aa2826a47c","slc_f3827963462b98f0d5cb4c896b89030a90865e343402c18fb5ba2f045fc0c40b"],"source_ids":["src_223e0d21fb59585da4a1cf5bca8f77fe"],"text":"Team is the canonical orchestration surface as of v4.1.7, running a staged pipeline: team-plan, team-prd, team-exec, team-verify, and team-fix (loop); the legacy `swarm` alias was removed.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:26:04Z","updated_by_operation":"op_9b019dd07bf941088bdc006a739c9195"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:26:04Z","created_by_operation":"op_9b019dd07bf941088bdc006a739c9195","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_f3dc0583e6eef2779645a908216986786a68db4a043bce2c6633c5ce8c23885d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"yeachan-heo/oh-my-claudecode@5281b19e0d64 snapshot 1fded3a5854f6853","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_42e74c7edb1ea38d81e9d71f5903fba26db4596deadbdca734ace00a37b96e3c"],"source_ids":["src_223e0d21fb59585da4a1cf5bca8f77fe"],"text":"The npm package exports TypeScript helpers such as `createOmcSession()` and prompt-expansion utilities built on `@anthropic-ai/claude-agent-sdk` as a library surface for Node.js programs.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:26:04Z","updated_by_operation":"op_9b019dd07bf941088bdc006a739c9195"}
